#==============================================================================================
#
#   style_sheet_invalidation_1 - CSS::StyleSheetInvalidation I: the targeted invalidation set
#                                of a style sheet or an inserted rule, and applying it to a
#                                document or a shadow root
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleSheetInvalidation.cpp (lines 1-381): which selectors can reach
#       light DOM under a shadow host, the rightmost-compound invalidation set of a style rule
#       with anchor rules for pseudo-element-only and trailing-universal compounds, the one-pass
#       walk that dirties matching elements, slotted assignees of dirty slots, and
#       invalidate_root_for_style_sheet_change.
